WEBVTT

00:14:59.316 --> 00:15:01.876
we've seen in the rest of the food chain.

00:15:01.916 --> 00:15:04.636
Intellectual property rights
should be weak,

00:15:04.676 --> 00:15:07.956
and antitrust laws should be strong.

00:15:09.036 --> 00:15:11.396
We have the possibility here

00:15:11.396 --> 00:15:15.836
of solving two of our great
existential crises

00:15:16.556 --> 00:15:18.236
with the same strategy.

00:15:18.756 --> 00:15:22.516
By shifting the production
of protein-rich food

00:15:22.556 --> 00:15:26.196
off the farm, and into the factory,

00:15:26.196 --> 00:15:30.396
we could help solve
these great predicaments